#: ../../src/fs.rst:289
msgid ""
"Opens `path` as a directory stream. On success, a `uv_dir_t` is allocated"
" and returned via `req->ptr`. This memory is not freed by "
"`uv_fs_req_cleanup()`, although `req->ptr` is set to `NULL`. The "
"allocated memory must be freed by calling `uv_fs_closedir()`. On failure,"
" no memory is allocated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../src/fs.rst:295
msgid ""
"The contents of the directory can be iterated over by passing the "
"resulting `uv_dir_t` to `uv_fs_readdir()`."
